          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>What we collect</h2>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Account info:</strong> username, email address, and a securely hashed password (we never store or can see your actual password) — or, if you sign in with Google/GitHub, the basic profile info those providers share with us.</li>
