            <p>To run your account (login, sessions, password resets), to judge your code and show you the result, to build your submission history and leaderboard standing, and — only when you ask for it — to generate an AI code review. That's the whole list. We don't run ads, and we don't sell or share your data with data brokers or advertisers.</p>
