            <p>Passwords are hashed with bcrypt, never stored in plain text. Submitted code runs in a resource-limited, isolated process with strict time/memory/process limits so one submission can't affect another. That said, no system is perfectly secure, and this is a personal project, not an enterprise-audited platform — don't submit code containing secrets, credentials, or anything sensitive.</p>
